H2680.definition:
חֲצִי הַמְּנַחְתִּי מְנַשֶּׁה (cha.tsi ham.nach.ti me.nash.sheh) — Chazi-manahethite

【Definición】
(half of the) Manahethites , of Manaheth resting place half of the Manassites;

H4453.definition:
מֶלְצָר (mel.tsar) — `steward`

【Definición】
guardian, an officer of the court or Melzar - a man living at the time of Exile and Return, first mentioned at Dan.1.11; also translated "steward";
